-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 3, §3.5 הפסקת עבודה
-- Ending a teacher's employment: the hearing; pedagogical dismissal of
-- probationers and of tenured teachers, with its visits, reports, warnings
-- and timetable; the director-general's decision and the parity committee;
-- dismissal on religious grounds; administrative dismissal of uncertified
-- teachers at the end of probation; general rules; and teachers moved from
-- the elementary school to the junior high school.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `3.5 הפסקת עבודה`

DECLARE `3.5 party` IS ONE OF
    `a takanon party` HAS `who` IS A Party
    `the district council of supervisors`
    `the personnel-in-teaching division`
    `the council for state-religious education`
    `the institutions division head`
    `the Minister`

DECLARE `dismissal action` IS ONE OF
    `hold a hearing`
    `prepare the list of doubtful teachers`
    `submit the list and reports to the district manager`
    `copy the list to the head of religious education`
    `bring the proposals for professional teachers to the general supervisors`
    `plan the sub-supervisors' visits`
    `visit a lesson` HAS `whole lesson` IS A BOOLEAN
    `send the six reports and the proposal form to the personnel division`
    `discuss a late pedagogical proposal`
    `send the report and the council's conclusions to the personnel division`
    `recommend a warning letter to the director-general`
    `prepare the dismissal letter for signature`
    `set up a parity committee with the Teachers' Union`
    `send the disagreement to the director-general`
    `send a warning or its removal, signed by the director-general`
    `notify the disqualification in writing`
    `notify the right to severance or transfer`
    `notify the severance due and the right to appeal`
    `arrange the dismissal by the Minister`
    `send the administrative-dismissal proposals`
    `send administrative dismissal letters`
    `send the director-general's warning`
    `apply to return to the elementary school`
    `pass a reasoned opinion to the district manager`
    `notify the decision with copies`
    `refer the request to the personnel division`

GIVEN who IS A `3.5 party`, `the act` IS A `dismissal action`, why IS A STRING
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.5 party` `dismissal action`
DECIDE `duty of` who `the act` why IS
    PARTY who
    MUST  a PROVIDED a EQUALS `the act`
    LEST  BREACH BY who BECAUSE why

-- ¶1: the district manager holds a hearing for every teacher proposed for
-- pedagogical or administrative dismissal.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2/p1
GIVEN `proposed for pedagogical or administrative dismissal` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.5 party` `dismissal action`
DECIDE `3.5 the hearing` `proposed for pedagogical or administrative dismissal` IS
    IF `proposed for pedagogical or administrative dismissal`
    THEN `duty of` (`a takanon party` `the district manager`) `hold a hearing` "3.5: a hearing for every teacher proposed for dismissal"
    ELSE FULFILLED

§§ `א Pedagogical dismissal during probation`

-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a The heading of clause א ("dismissal of probationers for educational reasons").

-- Times in days from 1 September; 1 Tevet and the Passover vacation move
-- with the Hebrew calendar and are inputs.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_1
GIVEN `day of 1 Tevet` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.5 party` `dismissal action`
DECIDE `א.1 the list of doubtful teachers` `day of 1 Tevet` IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the supervisor`
    MUST  `prepare the list of doubtful teachers`
    WITHIN `day of 1 Tevet`
    LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the supervisor` BECAUSE "3.5א.1: on 1 Tevet each supervisor lists the teachers whose continued employment is in doubt"

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_1/p2
DECLARE `office` IS ONE OF `supervisor`, `instructor`, `other office`

GIVEN o IS AN `office`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `acts as a supervisor in dismissals` o IF
    o EQUALS `supervisor` OR o EQUALS `instructor`

-- א.2: the supervisor plans to be able to visit 4 lessons by the start of
-- the Passover vacation.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_2
GIVEN `lessons visited before Passover` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the supervisor's visits are on time` `lessons visited before Passover` IF
    `lessons visited before Passover` AT LEAST 4

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_3__cls_a
GIVEN `day the Passover vacation ends` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.5 party` `dismissal action`
DECIDE `א.3א the list during Passover` `day the Passover vacation ends` IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the supervisor`
    MUST  `submit the list and reports to the district manager`
    WITHIN `day the Passover vacation ends`
    LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the supervisor` BECAUSE "3.5א.3א: the list goes to the district manager during the Passover vacation"

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_3__cls_b
GIVEN `state-religious` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.5 party` `dismissal action`
DECIDE `א.3ב copy to religious education` `state-religious` IS
    IF `state-religious`
    THEN `duty of` (`a takanon party` `the supervisor`) `copy the list to the head of religious education` "3.5א.3ב: a copy of the list to the head of religious education"
    ELSE FULFILLED

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_4
`א.4 the general supervisors' opinion` MEANS
    `duty of` (`a takanon party` `the district manager`) `bring the proposals for professional teachers to the general supervisors` "3.5א.4: proposals for professional teachers go to the general supervisors for their opinion"

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_5__cls_a
GIVEN `day the Passover vacation ends` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.5 party` `dismissal action`
DECIDE `א.5א planning the sub-visits` `day the Passover vacation ends` IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the district manager`
    MUST  `plan the sub-supervisors' visits`
    WITHIN `day the Passover vacation ends`
    LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the district manager` BECAUSE "3.5א.5א: the sub-supervisors' visits are planned by the end of the Passover vacation"

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_5__cls_b
GIVEN `state-religious` IS A BOOLEAN, `the head of religious education took part` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the sub-visits were planned properly` `state-religious` `the head of religious education took part` IF
    (NOT `state-religious`) OR `the head of religious education took part`

-- א.6-א.9: the visits. Two supervisors; the one over the institution visits
-- 4 whole lessons, the second 2; preferably spread over at least two
-- non-consecutive days, at most two lessons a day; the second usually after
-- the first's four; never together, in the same lesson or on the same day;
-- only from two months after the start of the year, reasonably spaced.
DECLARE `visit` HAS
    `by the direct supervisor` IS A BOOLEAN
    `day of the visit`         IS A NUMBER @desc days from 1 September
    `a whole lesson`           IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_6
GIVEN vs IS A LIST OF `visit`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `enough visits for a probationer` vs IF
        count (filter (GIVEN v YIELD v's `by the direct supervisor` AND v's `a whole lesson`) vs) AT LEAST 4
    AND count (filter (GIVEN v YIELD (NOT v's `by the direct supervisor`) AND v's `a whole lesson`) vs) AT LEAST 2

-- א.7 is a recommendation ("רצוי"): it is checked, not required.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_7
GIVEN `days of the direct supervisor's visits` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `spread as recommended` `days of the direct supervisor's visits` IF
    all (GIVEN d YIELD count (filter (GIVEN e YIELD e EQUALS d) `days of the direct supervisor's visits`) AT MOST 2)
        `days of the direct supervisor's visits`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_8
GIVEN vs IS A LIST OF `visit`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the two supervisors visit apart` vs IF
    all (GIVEN v YIELD all (GIVEN w YIELD v's `by the direct supervisor` EQUALS w's `by the direct supervisor`
                                       OR NOT v's `day of the visit` EQUALS w's `day of the visit`) vs) vs

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_9
GIVEN v IS A `visit`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the visit is not too early` v IF
    v's `day of the visit` AT LEAST 61

-- א.10-א.11: the reports. The direct supervisor writes a detailed report
-- (not on the evaluation form) on 2 lessons at least, the others may be on
-- the form; the sub-supervisor a detailed report on his two; all within one
-- school year; each describes the lesson, assesses it and the teacher, ends
-- in a clear reasoned proposal — dismissal or continued probation — and is
-- signed by hand.
DECLARE `supervision report` HAS
    `detailed`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `by the direct supervisor`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `describes and assesses the lesson and the teacher` IS A BOOLEAN
    `ends in a clear reasoned proposal` IS A BOOLEAN
    `signed by hand`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `school year`               IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_10
GIVEN rs IS A LIST OF `supervision report`
      `school year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the reports are as required` rs `school year` IF
        count (filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `by the direct supervisor` AND r's `detailed`) rs) AT LEAST 2
    AND count (filter (GIVEN r YIELD (NOT r's `by the direct supervisor`) AND r's `detailed`) rs) AT LEAST 2
    AND all (GIVEN r YIELD r's `school year` EQUALS `school year`) rs
    AND all `a report as א.11 requires` (filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `detailed`) rs)

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_11
GIVEN r IS A `supervision report`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a report as א.11 requires` r IF
        r's `describes and assesses the lesson and the teacher`
    AND r's `ends in a clear reasoned proposal`
    AND r's `signed by hand`

-- א.12: without two supervisors able to visit, the district manager may
-- empower an instructor-teacher instead of one; failing that, he asks, via
-- the pedagogical secretariat, for supervisors of another district.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_12
DECLARE `second visitor` IS ONE OF
    `a second supervisor of the district`
    `an instructor-teacher the district manager empowered`
    `a supervisor of another district`

GIVEN `supervisors available` IS A NUMBER, `an instructor-teacher available` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `second visitor`
DECIDE `who is the second visitor` `supervisors available` `an instructor-teacher available` IS
    IF `supervisors available` AT LEAST 2 THEN `a second supervisor of the district`
    ELSE IF `an instructor-teacher available` THEN `an instructor-teacher the district manager empowered`
         ELSE `a supervisor of another district`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_13
GIVEN `a professional teacher` IS A BOOLEAN, `in a pre-vocational class` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the general supervisor may be the sub-supervisor` `a professional teacher` `in a pre-vocational class` IF
    `a professional teacher` AND NOT `in a pre-vocational class`

-- א.14: the proposal is discussed in the district council of supervisors,
-- with the personal file before it.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_14
GIVEN `discussed in the council` IS A BOOLEAN, `the personal file considered` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the proposal was properly discussed` `discussed in the council` `the personal file considered` IF
    `discussed in the council` AND `the personal file considered`

-- א.15-א.16: if it is decided to propose dismissal, all six reports and the
-- proposal form go to the personnel division by the date the head office
-- sets (an input); a pedagogical proposal arriving after it is not
-- discussed.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_15
GIVEN `the head office's date` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.5 party` `dismissal action`
DECIDE `א.15 the proposal to the personnel division` `the head office's date` IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the district manager`
    MUST  `send the six reports and the proposal form to the personnel division`
    WITHIN `the head office's date`
    LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the district manager` BECAUSE "3.5א.15: the six reports and the form reach the personnel division by the date set"

`reports in a probationer's dismissal file` MEANS 6
#ASSERT `reports in a probationer's dismissal file` EQUALS 4 PLUS 2

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_16
GIVEN `day the proposal arrived` IS A NUMBER, `the head office's date` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the personnel division discusses it` `day the proposal arrived` `the head office's date` IF
    `day the proposal arrived` AT MOST `the head office's date`

-- א.17-א.19: negligence. Its kinds (א)-(ד); a proposal on those grounds goes
-- to the council of supervisors, with the personal file and the monthly
-- reports of lateness and absence; and the district manager's report to the
-- personnel division holds the facts and dates, the warnings given, and
-- copies of the written ones.
DECLARE `kind of negligence` IS ONE OF
    `unjustified absences, lateness included`
    `disobedience disturbing the work`
    `neglect of a teacher's duties`
    `breach of the duties the director-general's instructions set`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_17
`the kinds of negligence` MEANS
    LIST
        @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_17__cls_a
        `unjustified absences, lateness included`,
        @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_17__cls_b
        `disobedience disturbing the work`,
        @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_17__cls_c
        `neglect of a teacher's duties`,
        @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_17__cls_d
        `breach of the duties the director-general's instructions set`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_18
GIVEN `discussed in the council` IS A BOOLEAN, `with the file and the lateness reports` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a negligence proposal properly discussed` `discussed in the council` `with the file and the lateness reports` IF
    `discussed in the council` AND `with the file and the lateness reports`

DECLARE `negligence report` HAS
    `facts and dates`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `warnings given`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `copies of written warnings` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_19
GIVEN r IS A `negligence report`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the negligence report is complete` r IF
    @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_19__cls_a
        r's `facts and dates`
    @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_19__cls_b
    AND r's `warnings given`
    @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_a__subpara_19__cls_c
    AND r's `copies of written warnings`

§§ `ב Pedagogical dismissal of tenured teachers`

-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_b The heading of clause ב ("dismissal of tenured teachers for educational reasons").

-- ב.1-ב.2: the grounds.
DECLARE `ground for a tenured teacher` IS ONE OF
    `persistent serious disorder in lessons, or order kept by improper means`
    `negligence` HAS `negligence kind` IS A `kind of negligence`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_b__subpara_1
`ב.1 discipline` MEANS `persistent serious disorder in lessons, or order kept by improper means`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_b__subpara_2
GIVEN k IS A `kind of negligence`
GIVETH A `ground for a tenured teacher`
DECIDE `ב.2 negligence` k IS `negligence` k

`the negligence of ב.2` MEANS
    LIST
        @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_b__subpara_2__cls_a
        `ב.2 negligence` `unjustified absences, lateness included`,
        @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_b__subpara_2__cls_b
        `ב.2 negligence` `disobedience disturbing the work`,
        @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_b__subpara_2__cls_c
        `ב.2 negligence` `neglect of a teacher's duties`,
        @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_b__subpara_2__cls_d
        `ב.2 negligence` `breach of the duties the director-general's instructions set`

-- ב.3: the supervisor's finding goes to the council of supervisors on a
-- detailed report; the council's finding leads to (1) a proposed warning
-- letter from the director-general, or (2), if one was already given, a
-- proposal to dismiss.
DECLARE `council outcome` IS ONE OF `propose a director-general's warning`, `discuss dismissal`, `nothing`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_b__subpara_3__cls_a
GIVEN `on a detailed report` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the council may discuss the supervisor's finding` `on a detailed report` IF
    `on a detailed report`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_b__subpara_3__cls_b
GIVEN `the council finds the work deficient` IS A BOOLEAN, `already warned by the director-general` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `council outcome`
DECIDE `the council's outcome` `the council finds the work deficient` `already warned by the director-general` IS
    IF NOT `the council finds the work deficient`
    THEN `nothing`
    ELSE BRANCH
        @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_b__subpara_3__cls_b__pnt_2
             IF `already warned by the director-general` THEN `discuss dismissal`
        @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_b__subpara_3__cls_b__pnt_1
             OTHERWISE `propose a director-general's warning`

-- ב.4: the district manager sends the report and the council's reasoned
-- conclusions to the personnel division; ¶2: only after 4 whole lessons
-- were visited — 2 by the direct supervisor and 2 by another.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_b__subpara_4
`ב.4 to the personnel division` MEANS
    `duty of` (`a takanon party` `the district manager`) `send the report and the council's conclusions to the personnel division`
        "3.5ב.4: the supervisor's report and the council's conclusions go to the personnel division"

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_b__subpara_4/p2
GIVEN vs IS A LIST OF `visit`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `enough visits for a warning` vs IF
        count (filter (GIVEN v YIELD v's `by the direct supervisor` AND v's `a whole lesson`) vs) AT LEAST 2
    AND count (filter (GIVEN v YIELD (NOT v's `by the direct supervisor`) AND v's `a whole lesson`) vs) AT LEAST 2

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_b__subpara_5
GIVEN `the division finds grounds` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.5 party` `dismissal action`
DECIDE `ב.5 the warning recommended` `the division finds grounds` IS
    IF `the division finds grounds`
    THEN `duty of` `the personnel-in-teaching division` `recommend a warning letter to the director-general`
             "3.5ב.5: the division recommends the warning letter to the director-general"
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- ב.6: no improvement in the year after the warning: the proposal is
-- discussed as for probationers, save that (א) three supervisors visit —
-- one 4 whole lessons, the others 2 each; (ב) a parity committee convenes;
-- (ג) it goes to the personnel division about a month before the
-- probationers' date.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_b__subpara_6
GIVEN `improved in the year after the warning` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a tenured teacher may be proposed for dismissal` `improved in the year after the warning` IF
    NOT `improved in the year after the warning`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_b__subpara_6__cls_a
GIVEN `whole lessons by each of three supervisors` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `enough visits for a tenured teacher` `whole lessons by each of three supervisors` IS
        count `whole lessons by each of three supervisors` AT LEAST 3
    AND maximum `whole lessons by each of three supervisors` AT LEAST 4
    AND count (filter (GIVEN n YIELD n AT LEAST 2) `whole lessons by each of three supervisors`) AT LEAST 3

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_b__subpara_6__cls_b
`ב.6ב a parity committee` MEANS
    `duty of` `the personnel-in-teaching division` `set up a parity committee with the Teachers' Union` "3.5ב.6ב: a parity committee is convened"

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_b__subpara_6__cls_c
GIVEN `the probationers' date` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the tenured teachers' date` `the probationers' date` IS
    `the probationers' date` MINUS 30

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_b__subpara_7
GIVEN `an exceptional case` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be proposed in the year of the warning` `an exceptional case` IF
    `an exceptional case`

§§ `ג The director-general's decision`

-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_c The heading of clause ג, which applies to both א and ב.

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_c__subpara_1
GIVEN `state-religious` IS A BOOLEAN, `with the head of religious education's opinion` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the material is ready for the director-general` `state-religious` `with the head of religious education's opinion` IF
    (NOT `state-religious`) OR `with the head of religious education's opinion`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_c__subpara_2
GIVEN `the director-general decided to dismiss a probationer` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.5 party` `dismissal action`
DECIDE `ג.2 the probationer's letter` `the director-general decided to dismiss a probationer` IS
    IF `the director-general decided to dismiss a probationer`
    THEN `duty of` `the personnel-in-teaching division` `prepare the dismissal letter for signature` "3.5ג.2: the dismissal letter is prepared for the director-general's signature"
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- ג.3-ג.4: a tenured teacher: a parity committee with the Teachers' Union;
-- if it recommends dismissal, the letter; if it disagrees, the views and the
-- district manager's opinion go to the director-general to decide.
DECLARE `parity outcome` IS ONE OF `recommends dismissal`, `does not`, `disagrees`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_c__subpara_3
GIVEN o IS A `parity outcome`
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.5 party` `dismissal action`
DECIDE `ג.3 after the parity committee` o IS
    CONSIDER o
    WHEN `recommends dismissal` THEN `duty of` `the personnel-in-teaching division` `prepare the dismissal letter for signature` "3.5ג.3: the letter follows the committee's recommendation"
    WHEN `does not` THEN FULFILLED
    @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_c__subpara_4
    WHEN `disagrees` THEN `duty of` `the personnel-in-teaching division` `send the disagreement to the director-general` "3.5ג.4: a divided committee's views go to the director-general to decide"

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_c__subpara_5
GIVEN `the district manager recommends a warning or its removal` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the director-general decides on the warning` `the district manager recommends a warning or its removal` IF
    `the district manager recommends a warning or its removal`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_c__subpara_6
`ג.6 warnings signed by the director-general` MEANS
    `duty of` `the personnel-in-teaching division` `send a warning or its removal, signed by the director-general` "3.5ג.6: warning letters, and their removal, go out over the director-general's signature"

§§ `ד Dismissal on religious grounds`

-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_d The heading of clause ד ("dismissal on religious grounds").

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_d__subpara_1
`ד.1 notice of disqualification` MEANS
    `duty of` `the council for state-religious education` `notify the disqualification in writing`
        "3.5ד.1: the council notifies the head of religious education and the teacher in writing, with copies"

DECLARE `after disqualification` IS ONE OF
    `severance pay or transfer to state education, as he chooses`
    `severance pay, with a right of appeal`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_d__subpara_2 akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_d__subpara_2/p2
GIVEN `the district manager agrees to employ him in state education` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `after disqualification`
DECIDE `what the disqualified teacher is offered` `the district manager agrees to employ him in state education` IS
    IF `the district manager agrees to employ him in state education`
    THEN `severance pay or transfer to state education, as he chooses`
    ELSE `severance pay, with a right of appeal`

-- ד.2 ¶2: one who chooses the transfer waits his turn with those moved with
-- reservations from other districts, by seniority and rights. ד.3-ד.4: one
-- the manager cannot employ, for the supervision's negative opinion, is told
-- his severance and his right to appeal to the institutions division head;
-- if the appeal fails, the district manager arranges his dismissal by the
-- Minister.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_d__subpara_3 akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_d__subpara_3/p2
GIVEN `negative supervision opinion bars state employment` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.5 party` `dismissal action`
DECIDE `ד.3 notice of severance and appeal` `negative supervision opinion bars state employment` IS
    IF `negative supervision opinion bars state employment`
    THEN `duty of` (`a takanon party` `the district manager`) `notify the severance due and the right to appeal` "3.5ד.3: the teacher is told his severance and his right of appeal"
    ELSE FULFILLED

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_d__subpara_4
GIVEN `the appeal was rejected` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.5 party` `dismissal action`
DECIDE `ד.4 dismissal by the Minister` `the appeal was rejected` IS
    IF `the appeal was rejected`
    THEN `duty of` (`a takanon party` `the district manager`) `arrange the dismissal by the Minister` "3.5ד.4: after a rejected appeal the district manager arranges the dismissal by the Minister"
    ELSE FULFILLED

§§ `ה Administrative dismissal`

-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_e The heading of clause ה ("administrative dismissal of uncertified teachers at the end of probation").

DECLARE `kind of teacher` IS ONE OF `general teacher`, `professional teacher`, `kindergarten teacher`

@desc An uncertified teaching employee at the end of probation, as far as section 3.5ה asks about it.
DECLARE `uncertified teacher` HAS
    `kind`                                     IS A `kind of teacher`
    `a graduate of an Israeli teachers' seminary` IS A BOOLEAN
    `certified by the Passover exams of the last probation year` IS A BOOLEAN
    `subjects still owed`                      IS A NUMBER @desc exam subjects still owed, summer course not counted
    `owes Hebrew, or the subject he teaches`   IS A BOOLEAN @desc Hebrew for a general or kindergarten teacher, his own subject for a professional teacher (ה.2)
    `supervision opinion at least medium`      IS A BOOLEAN
    `years of seniority`                       IS A NUMBER
    `warned by the district manager last year` IS A BOOLEAN

-- ה.1: dismissed administratively at the end of probation if not certified
-- by then — in practice by the Passover supplementary exams of the last
-- probation year.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_e__subpara_1
GIVEN t IS AN `uncertified teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `liable to administrative dismissal under ה.1` t IF
        NOT t's `a graduate of an Israeli teachers' seminary`
    AND NOT t's `certified by the Passover exams of the last probation year`

-- ה.2: "notwithstanding 1", not dismissed: one owing two subjects at most,
-- not Hebrew (or, for a professional teacher, not his own subject), with a
-- medium-or-better supervision opinion.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_e__subpara_2
GIVEN t IS AN `uncertified teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `protected by ה.2` t IF
    @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_e__subpara_2__cls_a akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_e__subpara_2__cls_b akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_e__subpara_2__cls_c
        t's `subjects still owed` AT MOST 2
    AND NOT t's `owes Hebrew, or the subject he teaches`
    AND t's `supervision opinion at least medium`

-- ה.3: with 4 or 5 years' seniority, warned by the district manager the year
-- before, not certified and still owing two exams or more: proposed for
-- administrative dismissal.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_e__subpara_3
GIVEN t IS AN `uncertified teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `proposed for administrative dismissal under ה.3` t IF
        (t's `years of seniority` EQUALS 4 OR t's `years of seniority` EQUALS 5)
    AND t's `warned by the district manager last year`
    AND NOT t's `certified by the Passover exams of the last probation year`
    AND t's `subjects still owed` AT LEAST 2

-- F-3.5-a: a teacher owing exactly two subjects, neither Hebrew, with a
-- medium opinion, 4 years' seniority and last year's warning is protected by
-- ה.2 ("will not be dismissed") and proposed for dismissal by ה.3. The
-- reading adopted: ה.3, the narrower and more particular rule (warned,
-- seniority 4-5), governs its case; ה.2 governs the rest.
GIVEN t IS AN `uncertified teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `administratively dismissed` t IF
        `proposed for administrative dismissal under ה.3` t
    OR (`liable to administrative dismissal under ה.1` t AND NOT `protected by ה.2` t)

`a warned general teacher owing two subjects` MEANS
    `uncertified teacher` WITH
        `kind`                                     IS `general teacher`
        `a graduate of an Israeli teachers' seminary` IS FALSE
        `certified by the Passover exams of the last probation year` IS FALSE
        `subjects still owed`                      IS 2
        `owes Hebrew, or the subject he teaches`   IS FALSE
        `supervision opinion at least medium`      IS TRUE
        `years of seniority`                       IS 4
        `warned by the district manager last year` IS TRUE

`ה.2 protects and ה.3 proposes the same teacher` MEANS
        `protected by ה.2` `a warned general teacher owing two subjects`
    AND `proposed for administrative dismissal under ה.3` `a warned general teacher owing two subjects`
#ASSERT `ה.2 protects and ה.3 proposes the same teacher`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_e__subpara_4
GIVEN `supervision opinion given` IS A BOOLEAN, `average grade recorded` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the administrative proposal is complete` `supervision opinion given` `average grade recorded` IF
    `supervision opinion given` AND `average grade recorded`

-- ה.5: where pedagogical dismissal of an uncertified teacher was decided,
-- it is carried out, in preference to administrative dismissal (which leaves
-- the way back open on certification).
DECLARE `kind of dismissal` IS ONE OF `pedagogical`, `administrative`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_e__subpara_5
GIVEN `pedagogical dismissal decided` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `kind of dismissal`
DECIDE `the dismissal carried out` `pedagogical dismissal decided` IS
    IF `pedagogical dismissal decided` THEN `pedagogical` ELSE `administrative`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_e__subpara_6
`ה.6 the treatment sheet` MEANS "the district's proposals for administrative dismissal are made on the 'treatment sheet' form"

-- ה.7: by 15 May (day 256 from 1 September); ה.8: letters by 30 June (day
-- 302).
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_e__subpara_7
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.5 party` `dismissal action`
DECIDE `ה.7 proposals by 15 May` IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the district manager`
    MUST  `send the administrative-dismissal proposals`
    WITHIN 256
    LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the district manager` BECAUSE "3.5ה.7: the district's proposals reach the personnel division by 15 May"

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_e__subpara_8
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.5 party` `dismissal action`
DECIDE `ה.8 letters by 30 June` IS
    PARTY `the personnel-in-teaching division`
    MAY   `send administrative dismissal letters`
    WITHIN 302

-- ה.9: dismissed administratively with a positive opinion (3 and up): (א)
-- may train in the joint programmes and sit the exams until the Passover
-- after the dismissal; (ב) may apply again if all exams are passed by then,
-- and is sent back to the district he worked in.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_e__subpara_9
GIVEN `supervision grade` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a positive opinion` `supervision grade` IF
    `supervision grade` AT LEAST 3

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_e__subpara_9__cls_a
GIVEN `supervision grade` IS A NUMBER, `day of the exam` IS A NUMBER, `the next Passover` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may sit the exam` `supervision grade` `day of the exam` `the next Passover` IF
    `a positive opinion` `supervision grade` AND `day of the exam` AT MOST `the next Passover`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_e__subpara_9__cls_b
GIVEN `supervision grade` IS A NUMBER, `day all exams were passed` IS A NUMBER, `the next Passover` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may apply again, to the same district` `supervision grade` `day all exams were passed` `the next Passover` IF
    `a positive opinion` `supervision grade` AND `day all exams were passed` AT MOST `the next Passover`

§§ `ו General`

-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_f The heading of clause ו ("general").

DECLARE `kind of institution` IS ONE OF
    `kindergarten`, `elementary school`, `special school`, `school for working youth`, `other institution`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_f__subpara_1
GIVEN i IS A `kind of institution`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `these procedures apply` i IF
    NOT i EQUALS `other institution`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_f__subpara_2
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `part of the position the duty to dismiss covers` `position fraction` IS
    min `position fraction` 1

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_f__subpara_3
`these procedures do not limit the Minister's or the Ministry's statutory powers` MEANS TRUE

§§ `ז Teachers moved to the junior high school`

-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_g The heading of clause ז.

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_g__subpara_1
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.5 party` `dismissal action`
DECIDE `ז.1 asking to return` IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the teaching employee`
    MAY   `apply to return to the elementary school`
    HENCE `duty of` (`a takanon party` `the supervisor`) `pass a reasoned opinion to the district manager`
              "3.5ז.1: the general supervisor's opinion, drawing on the personal file, goes to the district manager"

DECLARE `return outcome` IS ONE OF `approved and notified`, `sent to the personnel division to decide`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_g__subpara_2 akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_g__subpara_3
GIVEN `the district manager approves` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `return outcome`
DECIDE `the request's course` `the district manager approves` IS
    IF `the district manager approves` THEN `approved and notified` ELSE `sent to the personnel division to decide`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_g__subpara_4
`ז.4 the decision notified` MEANS
    `duty of` `the personnel-in-teaching division` `notify the decision with copies`
        "3.5ז.4: the division tells the district manager its decision, copied to the general supervisor"

-- ז.5: a teacher proposed for dismissal who does not ask to return goes
-- through the usual process, from the director-general's warning; ¶2: the
-- warning may be delivered until 30 June (day 302).
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_g__subpara_5 akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_2__para_g__subpara_5/p2
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.5 party` `dismissal action`
DECIDE `ז.5 the director-general's warning` IS
    PARTY `the personnel-in-teaching division`
    MAY   `send the director-general's warning`
    WITHIN 302

-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_3 The heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_3/p1 A source: circular of the head of the personnel division תשמ"ה/7.
-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_5__hc_3/p2 A source: circular of the head of the personnel division of 15.4.96.

-- Worked examples.
`four by the direct supervisor and two by another` MEANS
    LIST `visit` TRUE 70 TRUE, `visit` TRUE 80 TRUE, `visit` TRUE 95 TRUE, `visit` TRUE 110 TRUE,
         `visit` FALSE 130 TRUE, `visit` FALSE 140 TRUE
#ASSERT `enough visits for a probationer` `four by the direct supervisor and two by another`
#ASSERT `the two supervisors visit apart` `four by the direct supervisor and two by another`
#ASSERT `enough visits for a tenured teacher` (LIST 4, 2, 2)
#ASSERT `the council's outcome` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `discuss dismissal`
#ASSERT `administratively dismissed` `a warned general teacher owing two subjects`

#TRACE `ה.7 proposals by 15 May` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the district manager` DOES `send the administrative-dismissal proposals` AT 250
#TRACE `3.5 the hearing` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the district manager` DOES `hold a hearing` AT 5
